[00:57.07]But hear me now, beneath the crack and roar
[01:04.21]Beneath the rockets bursting overhead
[01:11.66]There is a sorrow woven in this joy
[01:18.83]For every flame we light doth light the dead

[01:26.84]Sumar deyr — the summer it is dying
[01:33.74]Each spark that climbs doth climbeth toward its fall
[01:41.31]The brightest fire is the fire that endeth
[01:48.86]And we who light it brightest know it all

[01:56.81]Allt fýkr — all doth blow away
[02:03.49]Even this light... even this night... even we!

[02:11.84]The fire we raise against the coming dark
[02:18.54]Is the very thing that showeth us the dark!
[02:25.88]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir!
[02:29.95]We knew this all along!
[02:33.30]That the sweetest songs of summer
[02:36.86]Are the summer's ending song!
[02:41.11]Allt fýkr! Allt fýkr!
[02:44.55]Even the brightest flame!
[02:47.68]And still we light it — still we light it!
[02:51.66]And we love it all the same!

[03:02.37]I watch my father's father by the fire
[03:09.76]His face lit gold, his eyes upon the sea
[03:16.91]He hath seen how many of these burning nights?
[03:24.13]And how many more remaineth unto he?

[03:32.54]Allt fýkr — all doth blow away
[03:40.08]Even this light... even this night... even we!

[03:47.17]The fire we raise against the coming dark
[03:54.19]Is the very thing that showeth us the dark!
[04:01.62]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir!
[04:05.26]We knew this all along!
[04:08.82]That the sweetest songs of summer
[04:12.30]Are the summer's ending song!
[04:16.30]Allt fýkr! Allt fýkr!
[04:19.97]Even the brightest flame!
[04:23.08]And still we light it — still we light it!
[04:26.84]And we love it all the same!

[04:48.75]Hvarfit...
[04:53.66]The turning of the year...
[04:58.70]Allt fýkr...
